    "summary": "CPSV Editor v2026.11.2 and Linked Data Explorer v2026.11.3, both in production: the editor imports each statement whole and reads a field only from its own property, its publish dialog shows the steps publishing really takes, and a lapsed session asks to sign in again; the Linked Data Explorer accepts only access tokens, says when sign-in cannot be checked, explains a failed publish, and reports a required service described elsewhere as a warning.",
